@nsobid-1F1C44F29E77B5D6C7AA5A518E724318

# Splatoon 2 March 24 2017 prototype - Disable FXAA

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Disables the FXAA post-process anti-aliasing pass in agl::pfx::FilterAA::draw.
// The filter dispatches on its antialias_type field (this+0x428): 0 = FXAA,
// 1 = ReduceAA, 2 = callback. This redirects only the FXAA case (type 0) to the
// plain pass-through copy (agl::utl::ImageFilter2D::drawTexture), so the frame is
// presented unfiltered instead of FXAA-blurred. ReduceAA/callback are left intact.
//
// Patch: the CBNZ that guards the FXAA fall-through is turned into an unconditional
// branch to the pass-through path.

@enabled
0171043C 0C000014   // B (pass-through)   (was CBNZ W8, <post-draw>)
@stop

// Effect reverse-engineered against the agl/gsys engine; this symbol-bearing build
// names agl::pfx::FilterAA::draw directly. Same fix as the retail 5.5.2 / QA mods.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-visuen-mods
